config TOTEM_REGOUT0_3V3
	bool "Program UICR.REGOUT0 to 3.3 V on first boot"
	depends on SOC_NRF52840
	default n
	help
	  The Super52840 controller supplies the chip on VDDH while an
	  external 3.3 V LDO also drives VDD. With REGOUT0 left at the
	  factory 1.8 V the internal REG0 and the LDO disagree. This writes
	  3.3 V once (UICR is persistent, survives reflashing, and can only
	  be undone by a full erase over SWD), then resets.
